Now what all of those people who bought it
might not realize is that the updated MacBook

00:01:04.199 --> 00:01:10.880
Air with the much better design, display,
newer specs, bigger trackpad, and more, is

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:16.189
also available for just $759 Renewed on Amazon.

00:01:16.189 --> 00:01:23.899
Yes, that’s the 2018 MacBook Air with the
lastest design, for only around $750 which

00:01:23.899 --> 00:01:29.000
is unheard of because the retail price at
