00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:33.390
Now a lot of people steer clear from Renewed
models because they’re not brand new, but

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:36.770
for only $750, that’s a steal!

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:42.200
And plus, Amazon gives you a 90-day money
back guarantee if you have any issues with

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.770
it, which is much more than the regular 30-day
return policy.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:47.830
But this ordeal doesn’t end there.

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:53.289
We actually found a MacBook Pro Renewed for
